  "limitations": "MR-08 remains IN_PROGRESS and the original 17-package objective is incomplete. A query route can represent a node outside the target group, but this does not authorize it or provide a public routing-only service: the current receiver maps physical origins to configured current members and the host still requires a local replica. Independent namespace grants, independent peer-pool installation, routing-only bindings, directory integration and final read-contract audit remain open. Existing consensus message routes and member checks are unchanged. Query headers are a marker-1 hard cutover requiring compatible experimental peers; no old reader or conversion exists. One ignored transport child entry point is excluded from owning counts and invoked by its parent. Native callbacks are trusted/cooperative. These same-machine embedded/loopback and child-process tests do not qualify physical power loss, zones, production capacity or full release/scaling gates. S3 archive/restore, snapshots, automatic repair, effects and the remaining packages are pending. Existing vendored warnings remain visible.",
